Shared workspace packages live here.

Empty on purpose. `types/` is the one shared package today, and it stays
where it is so `make types` and scripts/gen_types.py keep working.

Add a package here when a SECOND consumer needs the same code -- not in
anticipation of one. Candidates, none of them earned yet:

  packages/ui          only once apps/admin and apps/store genuinely
                       share a component. A dense data table and a
                       marketing product page pull in opposite
                       directions, so this may never be earned.
  packages/api-client  only if importing AppType straight from apps/api
                       stops being enough for hc.
